WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.604
Meet the Star: an aging-in-place senior, at home, with the phone she already has.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:11.972
She taps Start, and her phone's camera opens. Thirty seconds, no cuff or watch.

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:15.723
Her family sees how she is, without a call.

00:00:16.633 --> 00:00:22.321
Medicine reminders, and one tap for help. Her Angels are alerted, even on silent.

00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:29.809
Labs and appointments she chooses to share: stronger continuity-of-care information for hospital partners.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:34.008
Aurora Care. Stay close to the people who matter most.
